{
  "_comment": "Data-driven display-tree extension for the LVGL frontend. Each entry attaches a node (or subtree) under a named parent group exposed by buildDisplayTree (root, generalPanel, mainPanel, groupCIPV, groupGAG, groupFCW, statusPanel, leftPanel, groupTop, groupBottom). A leaf 'type' is image/value/blink/timed/dummy; 'group' is a logical container (mutex/mode). 'graphic_item' binds the node to a GraphicItem from EW8_Signals.json. 'widget':{'factory':...} delegates geometry to LvglWidgets (left_panel_sign/right_panel_sign/speed_limit_sign), keeping pixels byte-identical to the hand-built tree; otherwise an inline image is built from 'src'. Position with 'pos':[x,y] or 'align'+'offset'. 'scale' 256=1.0. Optional 'intro_anim'/'intro_x'/'intro_y' (container scale + x/y), 'move_to_front', 'divisor' (value), 'blocked_by':<id>. Edit and restart the app — no recompile.",

